    {
      "name": "Variants",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "LWJYRAWwrQRk2eeH",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "<p>There are multiple drone variants used by the T'au Empire. Select a variant for this drone: MV-1 Gun Drone (Pulse Carbines, Twin-Linked); MV-4 Shield Drone (grants one ally in its zone a Force Field with 1d10 Protection, overload 10); MV-7 Marker Drone (counts as having a Markerlight and as a spotter for For the Greater Good); MV-8 Missile Drone (Missile Pods with an appropriate load of missiles); DX-11 Exploratory Drone (counts as having an Auspex); MV-33 Grav-Inhibitor Drone (Action: enemies within Close Range make a Challenging (+0) Athletics test or are pushed to a different zone; failing by 3+SL causes Prone); MV-36 Guardian Drone (grants one ally within Medium Range a Force Field with 1d5 Protection, overload 5); MV-5 Stealth Drone (grants the effects of a Stummer to all characters in its zone); MV-31 Pulse Accelerator Drone (increases the Range of all Pulse Weapons in its zone by one step); DX-4 Technical Drone (grants +1SL to one ally in its zone for Tech tests); Shielded Missile Drone (combines MV-8 and MV-4, but only affecting itself); Sniper Drone (Longshot Pulse Rifle or Rail Rifle, plus the effects of a Stummer and Targeting Array).</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
